<amll:meta key="artists" value="王菲"/>
<amll:meta key="album" value="天空"/>
<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1443363511"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:37.987"><div begin="0.256" end="26.308" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="0.256" end="6.407" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0.256" end="4.170">我从来不曾抗拒你的</span><span begin="4.901" end="5.385">魅</span><span begin="5.385" end="6.407">力</span></p><p begin="7.483" end="12.648" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="7.483" end="7.913">虽</span><span begin="7.913" end="8.678">然你</span><span begin="8.678" end="11.032">从来不曾对我</span><span begin="11.032" end="11.697">着</span><span begin="11.697" end="12.648">迷</span></p><p begin="13.689" end="18.578" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="13.689" end="14.110">我</span><span begin="14.110" end="15.871">总是微笑</span><span begin="16.183" end="16.584">的</span><span begin="16.584" end="17.420">看</span><span begin="17.420" end="17.786">着</span><span begin="17.786" end="18.578">你</span></p><p begin="19.591" end="26.308" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.591" end="23.631">我的情意总是轻易就洋</span><span begin="23.631" end="24.149">溢</span><span begin="24.149" end="24.834">眼</span><span begin="24.834" end="26.308">底</span></p></div><div begin="28.938" end="55.562" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="28.938" end="35.316" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.938" end="29.427">我</span><span begin="29.427" end="32.352">曾经想过在寂寞</span><span begin="32.352" end="33.080">的</span><span begin="33.464" end="34.149">夜</span><span begin="34.149" end="35.316">里</span></p><p begin="36.324" end="41.364" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.324" end="36.678">你</span><span begin="36.678" end="39.816">终于在意在我的房</span><span begin="39.816" end="40.546">间</span><span begin="40.546" end="41.364">里</span></p><p begin="42.579" end="47.946" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.579" end="43.041">你</span><span begin="43.041" end="44.225">闭上眼</span><span begin="44.225" end="44.745">睛</span><span begin="44.995" end="45.427">亲</span><span begin="45.427" end="46.246">吻</span><span begin="46.246" end="46.611">了</span><span begin="46.611" end="47.946">我</span></p><p begin="48.635" end="55.562" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.635" end="53.054">不说一句紧紧抱我在你的</span><span begin="53.054" end="53.928">怀</span><span begin="53.928" end="55.562">里</span></p></div><div begin="1:02.230" end="1:56.335" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:02.230" end="1:05.772" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.230" end="1:02.858">我</span><span begin="1:02.858" end="1:03.311">是</span><span begin="1:03.311" end="1:03.831">爱</span><span begin="1:03.831" end="1:04.229">你</span><span begin="1:04.229" end="1:05.772">的</span></p><p begin="1:08.140" end="1:12.066" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.140" end="1:08.646">我</span><span begin="1:08.646" end="1:09.479">爱你</span><span begin="1:09.479" end="1:10.599">到</span><span begin="1:10.599" end="1:12.066">底</span></p><p begin="1:14.899" end="1:19.967" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.899" end="1:17.381">生平第一次我</span><span begin="1:17.381" end="1:17.982">放</span><span begin="1:17.982" end="1:19.117">下矜</span><span begin="1:19.117" end="1:19.967">持</span></p><p begin="1:20.526" end="1:27.080" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:20.526" end="1:24.975">任凭自己幻想一切关于我</span><span begin="1:24.975" end="1:25.843">和</span><span begin="1:25.843" end="1:27.080">你</span></p><p begin="1:30.998" end="1:34.970" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:30.998" end="1:31.849">你是</span><span begin="1:31.849" end="1:32.601">爱</span><span begin="1:32.601" end="1:32.984">我</span><span begin="1:32.984" end="1:34.970">的</span></p><p begin="1:36.970" end="1:40.802" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:36.970" end="1:38.216">你爱我</span><span begin="1:38.216" end="1:39.400">到</span><span begin="1:39.400" end="1:40.802">底</span></p><p begin="1:43.704" end="1:48.772" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:43.704" end="1:46.18